#N canvas 200 120 760 560 12;
#X text 20 10 fs_onset <threshold> <rearm> <refractory_ms> - fires once when the input rises to/above threshold \, outputting the value at the crossing. Re-arms only after the input falls below rearm AND refractory_ms have passed since the last fire. For acc_mag a good start is 2 1.3 120 (resting ~1 g \, sharp flicks 3-4 g)., f 84;
#X obj 20 100 inlet;
#X obj 20 130 t f f;
#X obj 20 170 moses \$1;
#X obj 80 210 spigot 1;
#X obj 80 250 t f b;
#X obj 80 470 outlet;
#X msg 160 290 0;
#X obj 200 290 delay \$3;
#X msg 200 330 1;
#X obj 400 170 moses \$2;
#X obj 400 210 t b;
#X obj 400 250 spigot 1;
#X msg 400 290 1;
#X text 120 210 armed;
#X text 450 250 refractory over;
#X text 400 130 below rearm level -> try to re-arm, f 34;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 0 3 0;
#X connect 2 1 10 0;
#X connect 3 1 4 0;
#X connect 4 0 5 0;
#X connect 5 0 6 0;
#X connect 5 1 7 0;
#X connect 5 1 8 0;
#X connect 7 0 4 1;
#X connect 7 0 12 1;
#X connect 8 0 9 0;
#X connect 9 0 12 1;
#X connect 10 0 11 0;
#X connect 11 0 12 0;
#X connect 12 0 13 0;
#X connect 13 0 4 1;
